Comment: 0,0:08:50.83,0:08:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it is...
Comment: 0,0:11:48.76,0:11:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Earthquake warning.
Comment: 0,0:24:30.98,0:24:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,[POSTED]
Comment: 0,0:24:31.56,0:24:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,[TWEETED]
Comment: 0,0:24:32.23,0:24:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,[POST UPLOADED]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.41,0:01:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.51,0:01:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.61,0:01:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.25,0:02:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.64,0:02:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Suzume, are you up yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.52,0:02:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.18,0:02:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}There's a high-pressure system over Kyushu...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.23,0:02:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.09,0:02:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget your lunch today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.94,0:02:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.99,0:02:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and Suzume...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.61,0:02:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be late tonight,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.49,0:02:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,so figure out dinner on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.32,0:02:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.92,0:02:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have a date, Tamaki?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.13,0:02:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, take all night!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.57,0:02:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's overtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.74,0:02:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The "Fisherman Experience" event prep.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.36,0:02:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.63,0:03:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Beautiful...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.61,0:03:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.06,0:03:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.29,0:03:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know of any ruins in this area?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.11,0:03:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Ruins...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.60,0:03:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm looking for a door.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.67,0:04:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, there's a little abandoned town
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.12,0:04:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,over by that mountain...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.55,0:04:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.58,0:04:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.00,0:04:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.40,0:04:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Did you watch yesterday's livestream?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.90,0:04:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It was amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.11,0:04:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.24,0:04:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.07,0:04:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Mornin', Aya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.68,0:04:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Why's your face all red?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.62,0:04:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It is!? Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.11,0:04:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.45,0:04:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.03,0:04:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot something!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.21,0:04:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What!? You're gonna be late...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.06,0:04:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Why...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.78,0:04:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,did I...?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.93,0:04:49.68,Signs,,0,0,0,,TONAMI RESORT VISITOR'S GUIDE
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.19,0:04:54.43,Signs,,0,0,0,,DO NOT ENTER
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.77,0:05:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.06,0:05:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't think of any other "ruins."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.81,0:05:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.36,0:05:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.00,0:05:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Mister?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.70,0:05:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.29,0:05:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,we've met somewhere before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.95,0:05:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I totally stalking him right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.57,0:05:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I should go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.61,0:06:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He said something about a door.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.95,0:06:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.82,0:06:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.26,0:06:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What!?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.16,0:06:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Why...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.52,0:06:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.71,0:07:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.30,0:07:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.80,0:07:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck is going on!?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.34,0:07:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Creepy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.96,0:07:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.13,0:07:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,To what do we owe the pleasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.91,0:07:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Lunch from your aunt?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.67,0:08:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I can taste the love from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.50,0:08:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.39,0:08:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you know those ruins by Kaminoura?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.09,0:08:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The old bathhouse district.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.76,0:08:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.21,0:08:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember it's in the mountains, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.82,0:08:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.34,0:08:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,There's this door...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.24,0:08:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.19,0:08:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,For real!?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.03,0:08:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Gonna leave us hanging?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.03,0:08:20.94,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,Spill the beans!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.33,0:08:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.41,0:08:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, is that a fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.79,0:08:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.96,0:08:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Over by the mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.03,0:08:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.16,0:08:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at the smoke!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.82,0:08:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.70,0:08:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Do you see anything, Aya?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.23,0:08:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.11,0:08:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.62,0:08:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Is it from the fields?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.04,0:08:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.84,0:08:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}W-What!?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.46,0:08:44.21,Signs,,0,0,0,,EARTHQUAKE WARNING
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.98,0:08:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,An earthquake?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.99,0:08:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Intensity 4.0!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.79,0:08:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you feel it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.97,0:08:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's shaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.16,0:08:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, an earthquake.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.10,0:08:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.06,0:08:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm wide open!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.17,0:08:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.31,0:09:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.99,0:09:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Think we're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.55,0:09:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Is it over?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.37,0:09:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}That was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.48,0:09:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a little scary...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.71,0:09:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The warning was a bit much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.61,0:09:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.86,0:09:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Look...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.72,0:09:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.78,0:09:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.27,0:09:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.45,0:09:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They can't see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.57,0:09:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Suzume!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.85,0:09:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.49,0:09:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't anyone...?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.86,0:09:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What {\i1}is{\i0} that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.52,0:09:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.63,0:09:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.87,0:10:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.79,0:10:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's that door!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.14,0:10:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.40,0:10:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing!?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.59,0:10:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.66,0:10:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.89,0:10:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.00,0:10:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.69,0:10:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,...not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.68,0:11:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Earthquake warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.22,0:11:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.87,0:11:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.44,0:11:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away from here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.89,0:11:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.02,0:12:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.83,0:12:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to close this, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.19,0:12:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,O Divine Gods who dwell beneath this land...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.44,0:12:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You have long protected us for generations...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.36,0:12:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Thy mountains and rivers...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.80,0:12:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,that we have long called our own...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.02,0:12:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Dad! C'mon, hurry! Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.98,0:12:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What's...!?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.72,0:12:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Haven't been to a bathhouse in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.19,0:12:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Mom, let's take a bath again!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.86,0:12:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Honey, are you having another drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.81,0:12:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Let's come again next year. On a family trip!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.53,0:12:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's closed!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.28,0:12:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I return to thee!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.81,0:13:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.76,0:13:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The Keystone was supposed to keep this place sealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.36,0:13:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.18,0:13:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.27,0:13:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you see the worm?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.95,0:13:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is the Keystone!?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.43,0:13:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Worm?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.18,0:13:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.62,0:13:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.48,0:13:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,This place became a Gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.52,0:13:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The worm comes through the Gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.20,0:13:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for helping me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.58,0:13:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, forget everything you saw here and go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.78,0:13:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.73,0:13:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! Your arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.64,0:13:52.64,Signs,,0,0,0,,MIYAZAKI BROADCASTING
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.66,0:13:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a pretty big earthquake.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.27,0:13:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Look at these shingles...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.15,0:14:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we got off pretty light.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.71,0:14:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Please go upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.87,0:14:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get the first aid kit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.08,0:14:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That's really not—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.19,0:14:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If you won't go to the hospital, \Nat least let me bandage it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.38,0:14:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he some kinda man-baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.69,0:14:39.19,Signs,,0,0,0,,HOW TO BECOME A NURSE
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.51,0:14:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,A child's chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.05,0:15:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Around 1:20PM this afternoon
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.21,0:15:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}there was an earthquake in Miyazaki
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.56,0:15:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}with a recorded magnitude of 6.3.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.12,0:15:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}There is no risk of a tsunami at this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.30,0:15:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}We do not have any information regarding injuries—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.70,0:15:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You know your stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.33,0:15:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,My mom was a nurse.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.51,0:15:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But first...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.29,0:15:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a ton of questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.18,0:15:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.38,0:15:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You said "worm." What did you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.21,0:15:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The worm is a giant force that dwells\Nbeneath the Japanese islands.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.27,0:15:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It has no rhyme or reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.79,0:15:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet, it rages and shakes the land if disturbed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.61,0:15:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But you just beat it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.14,0:15:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I only shut it away temporarily.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.28,0:15:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don't seal it with the Keystone, it'll appear again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.08,0:15:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean there'll be another earthquake?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.27,0:15:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my job to stop that from happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.08,0:15:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Your job...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.68,0:15:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, who exactly are yo—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.42,0:15:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for patching me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.44,0:16:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My name's Souta Munakata.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.50,0:16:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.43,0:16:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I'm Suzume Iwato.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.94,0:16:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,A cat?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.13,0:16:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my gosh, this kitten's a toothpick.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.66,0:16:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,One sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.79,0:16:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You must've been starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.14,0:16:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That earthquake was scary, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.42,0:16:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.58,0:16:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Want to become my cat?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.35,0:16:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.06,0:16:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.36,0:16:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.33,0:16:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,is kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.77,0:16:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.77,0:16:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.78,0:16:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,are in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.62,0:16:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,W-W-Whaaa—?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.61,0:16:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Souta? Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.63,0:17:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.04,0:17:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,...hell!?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.26,0:17:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Whaaaaa—!?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.70,0:17:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Souta?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.56,0:17:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.56,0:17:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.19,0:17:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this your doing!?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.80,0:17:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.94,0:17:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.81,0:17:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait, wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.72,0:17:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.27,0:17:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,No no no no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.43,0:17:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Suzume.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.39,0:17:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Tamaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.12,0:17:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, stepping out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.62,0:17:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.53,0:17:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I came home early, worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.15,0:17:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The earthquake!?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.06,0:17:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't pick up your phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.77,0:17:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry! Missed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.13,0:17:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But, I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.02,0:17:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.97,0:17:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume! Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.69,0:17:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, a kitty!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.03,0:18:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What {\i1}is{\i0} that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.18,0:18:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.23,0:18:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What is even happening right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.57,0:18:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Suzume!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.24,0:18:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.93,0:18:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Where...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.05,0:18:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,are you going!?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.66,0:18:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What the—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.07,0:18:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.46,0:18:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm {\i1}so{\i0} sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.92,0:18:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much for your patience.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.92,0:18:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We have been given clearance to depart.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.24,0:18:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We are now disembarking from the dock.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.99,0:18:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, did you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.28,0:18:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.88,0:19:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.68,0:19:00.49,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,A toy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.49,0:19:02.50,Signs,,0,0,0,,NO PETS
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.49,0:19:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You see that chair?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.41,0:19:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Very impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.93,0:19:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Where...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.86,0:19:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,did you go!?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.75,0:19:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,My gosh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.92,0:19:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you run!?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.51,0:19:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you do to me!?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.51,0:19:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you!?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.50,0:19:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.28,0:19:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.11,0:19:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.69,0:19:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.61,0:19:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Whaaaaat!?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.65,0:19:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I said...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.09,0:19:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm spending the night at Aya's.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.03,0:19:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.85,0:19:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be home tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.18,0:19:52.13,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,Now wait just one moment, Suzume.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.41,0:19:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You can stay over,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.88,0:19:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,but why is the first aid kit in your room?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.40,0:19:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you have someone over?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.94,0:20:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't even want to think about it, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.14,0:20:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you seeing some good-for-noth—!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.89,0:20:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.48,0:20:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,No boys! I'm hanging up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.47,0:20:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see that runnin' chair, missy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.10,0:20:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.91,0:20:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Souta.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.16,0:20:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This ship will reach Ehime by morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.97,0:20:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like the cat's ship is heading there too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.74,0:20:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.11,0:20:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I got some bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.97,0:20:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.10,0:20:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm not hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.47,0:20:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.81,0:20:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, why are you a chair?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.66,0:20:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently, that cat placed a curse on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.61,0:20:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,A curse!?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.97,0:20:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.77,0:20:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Does it hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.04,0:20:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.72,0:21:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You're warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.23,0:21:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, I have to figure this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.77,0:21:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Souta, there's something bothering me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.63,0:21:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,A relic in the ruins?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.40,0:21:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the Keystone!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.71,0:21:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You removed it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.88,0:21:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Removed?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.23,0:21:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.09,0:21:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That cat is the Keystone!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.08,0:21:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare it leave its post.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.25,0:21:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.90,0:21:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You set the Keystone free, and now it's cursed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.02,0:21:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.73,0:21:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.42,0:21:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.23,0:21:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.65,0:21:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my fault for not finding the door sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.08,0:21:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.32,0:21:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.03,0:21:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume, I'm a Closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.80,0:21:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,A "Closer"?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.42,0:21:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I close the open doors so that disaster won't spread.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.67,0:21:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I travel across Japan doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.15,0:21:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's our job as Closers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.96,0:22:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You're hungry, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.34,0:22:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.69,0:22:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We must turn the Keystone back and banish the worm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.40,0:22:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely then, I'll return to my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.02,0:22:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,So, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.05,0:22:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, you're going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.69,0:22:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.23,0:22:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.50,0:22:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.98,0:22:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you!?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.47,0:23:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Souta?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.90,0:23:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you always sleep like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.00,0:23:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart's pounding.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.70,0:23:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Thank you very much for riding the Shikoku Orange Ferry today.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.37,0:23:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Man it's hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.37,0:23:29.87,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,Finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.87,0:23:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You're goin' to Osaka?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.87,0:23:31.42,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.42,0:23:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I'll spend the night somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.60,0:23:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}On behalf of the entire crew, we hope to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.04,0:23:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.17,0:23:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, you are up!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.66,0:23:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't wake up,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.82,0:23:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I was beginning to think this was all a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.82,0:23:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I was asleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.63,0:23:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.73,0:23:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, how do we find that cat?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.08,0:23:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We should ask around the harbor first.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.08,0:23:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.71,0:23:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.98,0:23:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.31,0:24:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.94,0:24:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,the edge of Ehime?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.15,0:24:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, we came a long way.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.55,0:24:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Get on the next ferry, and you can make it home tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.26,0:24:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You should—
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.68,0:24:08.67,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.67,0:24:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it!?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.30,0:24:12.31,Signs,,0,0,0,,OMG! I FEEL LIKE I'M IN "WHISPER OF THE HEART"
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.77,0:24:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, a white cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.06,0:24:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.56,0:24:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,A kitten?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.06,0:24:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.06,0:24:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.06,0:24:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.31,0:24:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps "Daijin"?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.31,0:24:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Daijin?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.07,0:24:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You do seem pretty fancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.11,0:24:30.87,Signs,,0,0,0,,IT'S SO ADORABLE... SITTING NEXT TO ME.\N#WithDaijin
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.62,0:24:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,This is {\i1}so{\i0} him, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.27,0:24:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,How could this be...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.37,0:24:37.16,Signs,,0,0,0,,LOOK WHO I MET
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.16,0:24:38.12,Signs,,0,0,0,,GETTING OFF THE TRAIN
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.41,0:24:39.37,Signs,,0,0,0,,CONDUCTING!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.53,0:24:40.17,Signs,,0,0,0,,SNACK TIME
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.28,0:24:40.88,Signs,,0,0,0,,INSTAGRAM-ABLE
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.07,0:24:42.63,Signs,,0,0,0,,LOOKING SLY!!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.57,0:24:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,"Daijin"?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.32,0:24:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean he does kind of...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.78,0:24:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He's moving by train.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.16,0:24:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to go after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.64,0:24:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for everything, Suzume.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.52,0:24:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,This is goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.07,0:24:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Get home safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.40,0:24:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.39,0:25:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Your family's going to worry if you don't go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.15,0:25:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine. They let me make my own choices.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.59,0:25:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This could be very dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.12,0:25:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not safe for you to follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.17,0:25:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you've got bigger problems right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.41,0:25:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.41,0:25:14.53,Signs,,0,0,0,,I JUST SAW SOMETHING CRAZY!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.90,0:25:15.79,Signs,,0,0,0,,I SAW IT TOO!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.98,0:25:16.82,Signs,,0,0,0,,MYSTERY GIRL AND MOVING CHAIR
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.98,0:25:17.50,Signs,,0,0,0,,NEW ROBOT FROM BOST*N DYNAMICS!?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.82,0:25:18.91,Signs,,0,0,0,,SEND ME INFO!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.21,0:25:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.33,0:25:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous for you to walk in public.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.17,0:25:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's gonna catch you before you catch the cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.36,0:25:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess I've got no choice...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.32,0:25:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.81,0:25:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Until we find the Keystone...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.94,0:25:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.62,0:25:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,My pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.94,0:25:48.06,Signs,,0,0,0,,"DAIJIN" APPEARS ON TANGERINE FARM\N#WithDaijin
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.42,0:25:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Souta.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.32,0:26:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.48,0:26:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Whaaa—!?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.77,0:26:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold that side.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.99,0:26:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.81,0:26:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.42,0:26:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a lifesaver!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.43,0:26:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.59,0:26:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.81,0:26:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You're like a wizard.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.76,0:26:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd ya do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.65,0:26:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,My body reacted before I could think... I guess?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.18,0:26:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.16,0:26:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, amazin' either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.22,0:26:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Chika. A junior in high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.05,0:26:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.55,0:26:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Suzume.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.84,0:26:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Your uniform... You're not from 'round here, are ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.69,0:26:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.22,0:27:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You came all the way from Kyushu to look for a cat!?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.15,0:27:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.98,0:27:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.56,0:27:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.02,0:27:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, this photo...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.87,0:27:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's near here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.66,0:27:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.28,0:27:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.07,0:27:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I just remembered something.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.16,0:27:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, whaddya mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.30,0:27:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume!?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.59,0:27:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Can the worm show up anywhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.42,0:27:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The Gate in this area has opened.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.43,0:27:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to close it fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.79,0:27:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not going to make it at this rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.80,0:27:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.53,0:27:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.90,0:27:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.97,0:27:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Chika?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.20,0:27:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Dunno what's goin' on, but you're in a rush, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.66,0:27:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Get on!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.76,0:27:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure this is the way?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.67,0:27:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Few years back, there was a landslide.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.55,0:27:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothin' past here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.14,0:28:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's abandoned?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.28,0:28:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That's perfect. Keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.46,0:28:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Will there be another quake?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.92,0:28:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We must close the door before the worm falls to the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.75,0:28:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Or else...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.17,0:28:13.66,Signs,,0,0,0,,DO NOT ENTER
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.54,0:28:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.60,0:28:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.35,0:28:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks so much, Chika!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.18,0:28:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? S-Suzume?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.65,0:28:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume, you've done enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.26,0:28:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait! Souta!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.56,0:28:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.66,0:28:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Go back with that girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.05,0:28:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't go with that body!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.92,0:28:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.82,0:28:40.32,Signs,,0,0,0,,KASUGA MIDDLE SCHOOL
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.16,0:28:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The school's become a Gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.00,0:29:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.98,0:29:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't even...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.18,0:29:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.02,0:29:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.43,0:29:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Souta!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.82,0:29:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume!?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.91,0:29:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you not afraid to die!?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.42,0:29:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.53,0:29:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.62,0:29:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You lock the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.57,0:29:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Close your eyes and think of the people who lived here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.69,0:29:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The keyhole will appear.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.58,0:29:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You're telling me this now!?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.84,0:29:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Please! I can't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.76,0:29:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Close your eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.05,0:29:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Now feel all the emotion that should be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.86,0:29:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to their voices.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.84,0:29:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mornin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.27,0:29:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}G'morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.21,0:30:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've got exams tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.96,0:30:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Man, it's hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.99,0:30:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We can't lose the next match!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.77,0:30:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Come hang out after you graduate.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.31,0:30:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,O Divine Gods who dwell beneath this land...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.25,0:30:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You have long protected us for generations...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.60,0:30:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Thy mountains and rivers...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.71,0:30:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,that we have long called our own...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.97,0:30:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.00,0:30:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I return to thee!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.69,0:30:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We did it, Suzume.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.98,0:30:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You just prevented an earthquake.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.94,0:30:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.62,0:30:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.08,0:30:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.88,0:30:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We make a great team!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.27,0:31:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume, you're amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.56,0:31:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Another Gate will open.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.24,0:31:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The Keystone.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.40,0:31:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.79,0:31:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he open the door?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.69,0:31:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in Ehime?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.76,0:31:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume, you said you were staying at Aya's yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.48,0:31:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,"A little vacation"?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.91,0:31:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Not funny at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.61,0:31:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I had better see you home tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.67,0:31:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you staying tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.16,0:31:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Minoru, we got a table.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.36,0:31:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead. I'll catch up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.34,0:31:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll invite Tamaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.58,0:31:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That's NOT what I'm talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.61,0:31:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What about school?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.08,0:31:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume going through a rebellious phase?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.43,0:31:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.31,0:31:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me where you're staying tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.08,0:31:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And, I really hope you're alone, young lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.76,0:32:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Minoru...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.94,0:32:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Something on my face?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.19,0:32:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Shige made a reservation...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.06,0:32:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Where did—!?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.72,0:32:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.70,0:32:10.94,Signs,,0,0,0,,SORRY FOR HANGING UP
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.96,0:32:16.46,Signs,,0,0,0,,I'M GOOD!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.46,0:32:16.96,Signs,,0,0,0,,I PROMISE TO COME HOME SAFELY!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.96,0:32:18.82,Signs,,0,0,0,,PLEASE DON'T WORRY!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.82,0:32:20.46,Signs,,0,0,0,,*BOW*
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.45,0:32:21.45,Signs,,0,0,0,,READ
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.57,0:32:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.22,0:32:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I brought ya dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.18,0:32:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.72,0:32:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.07,0:32:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Mind if I join ya, Suzume?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.64,0:32:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.92,0:32:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you give me a sec?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.20,0:32:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.34,0:32:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You two enjoy yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.92,0:32:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like this body doesn't get hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.99,0:32:50.24,Signs,,0,0,0,,INN - AMABE
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.77,0:32:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.16,0:33:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It tastes sooo good...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.31,0:33:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, are you cryin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.94,0:33:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It just tastes so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.19,0:33:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You must've been starvin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.97,0:33:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,For some reason we just had a ton of customers today.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.68,0:33:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waitin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.18,0:33:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.07,0:33:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one putting me up tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.39,0:33:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,With a bath, yukata, and food!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.52,0:33:21.44,Signs,,0,0,0,,NEW MESSAGE
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.93,0:33:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.70,0:33:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.07,0:33:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,My aunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.81,0:33:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh man...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.09,0:33:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,She seriously needs a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.34,0:33:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Your aunt's single?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.75,0:33:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,How old is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.77,0:33:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,About 40, I think?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.14,0:33:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,She's really pretty, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.07,0:33:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just the two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.71,0:33:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,She's my guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.71,0:33:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.38,0:33:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.49,0:33:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But sometimes...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.82,0:33:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like I've stolen her most precious years.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.58,0:33:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.52,0:33:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You sound like her ex-boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.23,0:34:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my gosh!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.55,0:34:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish she'd just leave the nest already.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.22,0:34:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Speakin' of ex-boyfriends...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.05,0:34:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume, you ever dated anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.74,0:34:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Me? No...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.33,0:34:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Mmm-hmm, that's the best thing for ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.59,0:34:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothin' good comes from datin' guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.04,0:34:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you going out with someone, Chika?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.15,0:34:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanna hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.83,0:34:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Not again!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.32,0:34:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you clean the bath next?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.03,0:34:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.43,0:34:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.68,0:34:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.72,0:34:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Not just that...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.79,0:34:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Whaaa—!? For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.60,0:34:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Right? Boys are dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.07,0:34:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I got to go there again today thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.68,0:34:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,My middle school was over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.41,0:34:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,After the landslide a few years ago\Nthey abandoned the whole area.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.53,0:34:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Suzume.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.14,0:34:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What were you doin' there?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.11,0:34:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Covered in mud and all...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.24,0:35:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And what's with that chair?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.62,0:35:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Who exactly are ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.32,0:35:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That chair...is a memento from my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.94,0:35:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But now...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.94,0:35:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, it's hard to explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.28,0:35:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume, you're like a wizard.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.97,0:35:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Full o' secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.72,0:35:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But why do I feel like...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.68,0:35:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,you're doing somethin' really important?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.81,0:35:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Chika!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.57,0:35:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think I'm doing something important, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.57,0:35:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Modest much?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.16,0:35:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Some people just refuse to wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.89,0:35:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Who? Your BF?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.65,0:36:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have one!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.74,0:36:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean in general.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.34,0:36:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If they won't wake up...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.02,0:36:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,just give 'em a kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.32,0:36:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha—!?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.76,0:36:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard you're headin' home?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.36,0:36:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.23,0:36:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.67,0:36:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You're welcome anytime, y'hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.70,0:36:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.28,0:36:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.58,0:36:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy's amazin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.91,0:36:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It is unknown where this kitty came from,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.33,0:36:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,but he's crossing the cables of a suspension bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.84,0:36:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Uhhh...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.16,0:36:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't that somethin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.09,0:36:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Souta!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.15,0:36:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up already!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.63,0:36:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.67,0:36:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.37,0:36:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's your mouth?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.82,0:36:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.79,0:36:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.69,0:36:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.89,0:37:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't "What is it" me!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.62,0:37:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it's Daijin.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.87,0:37:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he trying to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.62,0:37:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}This kitty is creating a lot of buzz...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.00,0:37:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Gods follow naught but their own whims, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.61,0:37:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Gods?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.37,0:37:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That bridge leads to Kobe.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.58,0:37:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We should—
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.73,0:37:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.46,0:37:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You're leavin' soon, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.08,0:37:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, just getting dressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.64,0:37:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.13,0:37:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Use these, if ya want.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.18,0:37:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup. Suits ya better than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.95,0:37:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Ya stuck out in your uniform with that chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.45,0:37:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Chika...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.69,0:37:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I ever repay you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.94,0:37:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry nothin' 'bout it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.63,0:37:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Come visit sometime?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.19,0:37:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.00,0:37:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.29,0:37:54.67,Signs,,0,0,0,,TO KOBE
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.61,0:37:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.60,0:37:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to be clearer about what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.03,0:37:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Like waving your arms or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.17,0:38:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You{\i0} do it and people will be shocked and stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.13,0:38:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Chairs shouldn't be moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.42,0:38:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.58,0:38:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You {\i1}do{\i0} get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.06,0:38:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we go by bus?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.20,0:38:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The next bus is six hours from now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.59,0:38:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.95,0:38:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You said this chair was a memento of your mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.48,0:38:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.19,0:38:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does it only have three legs?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.33,0:38:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so young, I don't really remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.62,0:38:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But, I lost this chair once.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.13,0:38:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,When I found it, a leg was missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.27,0:38:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Where you headed?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.25,0:38:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't be any buses for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.87,0:39:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.98,0:39:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,A little soul searching?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.50,0:39:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Going to downtown Kobe?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.97,0:39:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That would be amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.47,0:39:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.59,0:39:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We were visiting their grandma's\Nand were on our way back to Kobe.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.64,0:39:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You really lucked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.40,0:39:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom, look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.75,0:39:19.91,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.91,0:39:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop touching her stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.18,0:39:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Okaaaay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.94,0:39:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.70,0:39:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.36,0:39:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are they staring at your stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.16,0:39:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.23,0:39:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.38,0:39:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Still staring...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.98,0:39:44.77,Signs,,0,0,0,,EHIME
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.98,0:39:45.77,Signs,,0,0,0,,TOKUSHIMA
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.48,0:39:56.03,Signs,,0,0,0,,KOBE
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.87,0:40:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.68,0:40:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't spill anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.83,0:40:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep her chair nice and clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.01,0:40:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.64,0:40:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You bet'cha!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.65,0:40:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't know you could see it from here...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.91,0:40:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The amusement park.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.13,0:40:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,An amusement park?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.57,0:40:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Over there, on the mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.87,0:40:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,My folks would take me there when I was little.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.04,0:40:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But things went downhill.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.06,0:40:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, they don't even have the money to tear it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.37,0:40:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,There's lots of lonely places like that these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.37,0:40:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.55,0:40:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The kids' daycare just texted
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.87,0:41:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,saying they had to close today.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.16,0:41:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, knock it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.34,0:41:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, I have to open the shop soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.75,0:41:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta find someone...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.71,0:41:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.28,0:41:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.19,0:41:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Huuuuuh!?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.28,0:41:15.04,Signs,,0,0,0,,KYUNOMIYA SUJI STRIP MALL
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.39,0:41:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.30,0:41:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want to play?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.19,0:41:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,House!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.94,0:41:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's make curry!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.78,0:41:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.80,0:41:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.54,0:41:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Whaaa—!?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.23,0:41:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't eat those!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.55,0:41:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever empties it first wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.55,0:41:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready? Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.26,0:41:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop that!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.87,0:41:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You're Mt. Fuji, 'kay?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.55,0:41:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready? Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.48,0:41:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.92,0:41:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,...I'm cut out for kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.62,0:41:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You need help.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.14,0:41:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What the—!?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.43,0:41:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Heeeeey! Isn't it amazing?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.88,0:41:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What a super cool toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.83,0:42:06.34,Signs,,0,0,0,,[BAR HARBOR]
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.83,0:42:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoooooa!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.82,0:42:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Wooooow!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.34,0:42:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too! Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.92,0:42:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,My turn next!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.43,0:42:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.85,0:42:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It talked!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.73,0:42:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,P-Pretty cool, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.04,0:42:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a chair-shaped robot...with built-in AI?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.05,0:42:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What's its name?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.20,0:42:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Souta.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.19,0:42:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Souta, what's tomorrow's weather!?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.28,0:42:27.29,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,Souta, play music!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.37,0:42:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Souta, a word game!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.29,0:42:28.77,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,Souta, are the stocks up today!?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.77,0:42:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Souta's not that smart, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.17,0:42:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that, Suzume?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.70,0:42:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It spoke again!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.97,0:42:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Running away from home?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.48,0:42:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I did it when I was a kid too.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.99,0:42:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,When you're at that age,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.85,0:42:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,the town, your parents... it's suffocating.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.27,0:42:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So—
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.84,0:42:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not talking about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.32,0:42:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.89,0:42:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is she going?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.37,0:42:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What did I do wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.79,0:43:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,She keeps putting me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.93,0:43:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't even tell me where she's staying tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.12,0:43:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What about her phone's GPS?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.28,0:43:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have access.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.76,0:43:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What about her bank account?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.57,0:43:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it linked to her phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.88,0:43:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.06,0:43:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,She's in Kobe...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.11,0:43:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Kobe?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.00,0:43:25.25,Signs,,0,0,0,,TRANSACTION HISTORY
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.54,0:43:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a long way from home.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.69,0:43:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let her be alone anymore...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.53,0:43:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, Tamaki?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.16,0:43:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If there's anything else I can do—
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.10,0:43:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Minoru.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.38,0:43:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm taking the day off tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.80,0:43:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.04,0:43:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, I'm taking the day off, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.72,0:43:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Why? You need to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.79,0:43:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.30,0:43:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.59,0:43:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you come down?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.02,0:43:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.28,0:43:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.90,0:43:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Rumi, you look gorgeous.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.65,0:43:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Like a different person, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.81,0:43:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The kids all good?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.92,0:43:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup. Sound asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.89,0:44:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, you can give me a hand over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.55,0:44:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's never this crowded...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.42,0:44:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.13,0:44:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,She's the help?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.33,0:44:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.84,0:44:14.53,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,What!?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.53,0:44:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.78,0:44:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to work the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.51,0:44:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.68,0:44:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Wash these. Quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.12,0:44:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.69,0:44:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ice, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.68,0:44:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.09,0:44:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Two wine glasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.35,0:44:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.11,0:44:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,No, the ones next to those.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.55,0:44:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.06,0:44:30.56,Signs,,0,0,0,,[NOW HIRING HOSTESSES]
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.49,0:44:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.85,0:44:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume, three hot towels.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.82,0:44:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.40,0:44:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.31,0:44:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the bottle?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.09,0:44:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.80,0:44:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,For Sasaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.70,0:44:37.32,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,R-Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.32,0:44:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I had too much to drink. And it was all your fault...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.74,0:44:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}How endearing it is from a tender young lady...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.64,0:44:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You're awfully young, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.44,0:44:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Come drink with an old lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.93,0:44:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't we sing a duet?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.16,0:44:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? So ya like 'em young, do ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.09,0:44:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.30,0:44:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Miki? You got us there.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.92,0:44:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh well.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.22,0:45:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, "Oh well"?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.90,0:45:01.68,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,Hey, Daijin!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.68,0:45:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Another glass!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.18,0:45:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha—!?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.46,0:45:06.55,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,Daijin, you big spender.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.18,0:45:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You rock!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.44,0:45:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You go!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.61,0:45:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't happening...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.81,0:45:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,U-Umm... That seat over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.90,0:45:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm? Oh, he's a first-time customer.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.57,0:45:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,C-Customer—
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.26,0:45:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He's quiet but getting along with regulars already.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.18,0:45:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, but doesn't he look a bit...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.58,0:45:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,...cat-like?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.20,0:45:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.56,0:45:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems pretty refined to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.17,0:45:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously!?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.09,0:45:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.13,0:45:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but gotta go!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.09,0:45:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Souta!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.35,0:45:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Daijin!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.12,0:45:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, just what are you—!?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.55,0:45:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume. How you doin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.67,0:45:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.62,0:46:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.36,0:46:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.47,0:46:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The worm.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.91,0:46:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Daijin!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.12,0:46:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.04,0:46:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.89,0:46:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.90,0:46:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it an earthquake?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.75,0:46:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.15,0:46:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Miki. Where's Suzume?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.62,0:46:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the amusement park!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.14,0:46:33.65,Signs,,0,0,0,,NOTICE OF CLOSURE\NTHANK YOU FOR 40 AMAZING YEARS
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.76,0:46:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ferris wheel!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.98,0:46:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's become a Gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.91,0:46:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Souta, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.67,0:46:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Daijin.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.84,0:46:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to catch Daijin and turn him back to a Keystone!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.33,0:46:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,While I do that, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.00,0:46:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.72,0:47:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Close the door and lock it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.92,0:47:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.76,0:47:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Get the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.81,0:47:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.77,0:47:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I can make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.78,0:47:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,My body...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.90,0:47:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I can really move!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.18,0:47:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting used to this!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.08,0:47:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't fail again.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.63,0:47:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.57,0:47:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You're goood!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.25,0:47:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Daijin!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.26,0:48:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, you will turn me back!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.59,0:48:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Look! The lights are on.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.87,0:48:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.38,0:48:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Wasn't it abandoned?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.65,0:48:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.53,0:48:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-Wh-Whoa—!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.84,0:48:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.75,0:48:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously!?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.70,0:48:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.24,0:49:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Become the Keystone, and seal that worm!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.28,0:49:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The Eastern Pillar alone will not hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.92,0:49:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.36,0:49:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Why!?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.37,0:49:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I've entrusted this duty to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.47,0:49:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.09,0:49:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.07,0:49:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Daijin's gonna play with Suzume.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.48,0:49:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,With Suzume?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.48,0:49:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.85,0:49:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened, Suzume!?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.25,0:49:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.30,0:49:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.18,0:49:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume!? Come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.05,0:49:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You mustn't go in!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.01,0:49:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.20,0:49:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume, you're inside a Ferris wheel!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.84,0:49:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up! You're going to fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.43,0:49:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.60,0:49:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,O Divine Gods who dwell beneath this land...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.60,0:50:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You have long protected us for generations...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.29,0:50:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Thy mountains and rivers...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.27,0:50:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,that we have long called our own...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.60,0:50:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Whoa, it's so high up! Cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.78,0:50:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Don't have too much fun now.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.14,0:50:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}We should come here again, together!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.52,0:50:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}This is our anniversary. Let's come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.76,0:50:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}An amusement park on our first date is so cliché!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.75,0:50:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Daddy, let's come back again!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.89,0:50:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume! Come!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.45,0:50:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Souta?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.16,0:50:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,O Divine Gods who dwell beneath this land...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.90,0:50:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You have long protected us for generations...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.54,0:50:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Thy mountains and rivers...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.15,0:50:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,that we have long called our own...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.57,0:50:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.57,0:50:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I return to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.74,0:51:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Daijin?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.45,0:51:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Gone. Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.09,0:51:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.75,0:51:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.04,0:51:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.73,0:51:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You were amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.32,0:51:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.46,0:51:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.67,0:51:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What were you looking at, beyond the Gate?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.47,0:51:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha—
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.47,0:51:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,A bright night sky filled with stars and fields...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.05,0:51:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ever-After.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.61,0:51:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So you can see it!?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.92,0:51:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,"Ever-After"?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.84,0:51:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,This world's other half, where the worm dwells.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.67,0:51:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And, where all time exists simultaneously.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.45,0:51:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I could see it, but I couldn't go in.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.97,0:52:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ever-After is where all souls go to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.28,0:52:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not somewhere the living can reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.84,0:52:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a place we're supposed to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.82,0:52:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The troublemaker's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.61,0:52:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume, where were you!?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.04,0:52:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, um... I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.86,0:52:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You had me worried sick! Running off at this hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.68,0:52:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, she's all right, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.53,0:52:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But—!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.87,0:52:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,How many times have we run away from home?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.40,0:52:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't we have a bite for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.85,0:52:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.96,0:52:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,How about fried udon?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.46,0:52:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! With a sunny side up on top.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.23,0:52:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And tuna-mayo!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.48,0:52:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.01,0:52:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And you, Suzume?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.13,0:52:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,We actually put potato salad on top.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.23,0:52:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.90,0:52:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,On fried udon?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.64,0:52:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,O-M-G.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.10,0:52:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Think about the calories.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.11,0:52:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Sooo hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.11,0:52:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the meal!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.37,0:52:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Delish!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.90,0:52:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll gain some weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.99,0:52:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Needs a beer!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.21,0:53:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Should we?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.36,0:53:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}After drinking all night?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.22,0:53:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Sure, why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.16,0:53:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Join us, Souta.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.89,0:53:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Didn't expect the potato salad, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.99,0:53:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'm making this for my boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.11,0:53:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.40,0:53:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}What boyfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.92,0:53:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'll have one in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.67,0:53:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with that chair?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.20,0:53:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.29,0:53:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,A kid's chair?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.38,0:53:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you on it?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.81,0:53:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,A Kobe souvenir...?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.68,0:53:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not making any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.45,0:53:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,They must've thought you were weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.44,0:53:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.15,0:53:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you travel like this all the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.69,0:53:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Not all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.05,0:53:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a flat in Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.36,0:53:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,After college, I plan to be a teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.76,0:53:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What!? You're a university student?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.70,0:53:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.70,0:53:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And...a job!?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.81,0:53:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What about {\i1}this{\i0} job!?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.55,0:53:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Being a Closer has been in my family for generations.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.58,0:53:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll continue that.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.63,0:53:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But it doesn't put food on the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.64,0:53:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.55,0:53:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's an important job.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.36,0:54:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Most important jobs, people shouldn't see.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.54,0:54:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to get back into my own body.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.97,0:54:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So I can continue this and become a teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.31,0:54:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But... I'm already...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.89,0:54:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps, I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.32,0:54:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,already...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.70,0:54:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's getting farther.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.83,0:54:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The light grows dimmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.98,0:54:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And so do the voices.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.91,0:54:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,My body...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.04,0:54:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,My mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.24,0:54:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.61,0:54:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.89,0:54:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.96,0:54:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Cold...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.26,0:54:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,So cold...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.06,0:55:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.11,0:55:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this where...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.68,0:55:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I meet my end?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.18,0:55:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Souta?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.78,0:55:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Souta!?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.39,0:55:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.34,0:55:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Took you long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.85,0:55:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, there's another photo of Daijin.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.44,0:55:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.51,0:55:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.66,0:55:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Did...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.89,0:55:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you just do something to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.95,0:55:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.08,0:56:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}The Chugoku Expressway south towards Okayama...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.68,0:56:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I was counting on you to help me at the bar tonight, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.12,0:56:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, this is for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.78,0:56:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You look even more like a runaway child now.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.53,0:56:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Rumi, thank you so much for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.59,0:56:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Mmhmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.17,0:56:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Just be sure to send word to your guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.94,0:56:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.06,0:56:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.85,0:56:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I totally forgot about Tamaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.30,0:56:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,55...unread messages?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.68,0:56:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,She's coming to get me?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.16,0:56:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume, you can make the next train.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.11,0:56:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Buy a ticket. Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.11,0:56:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The bullet train?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.16,0:56:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We know where Daijin is, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.12,0:56:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the quickest way, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.92,0:56:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,To Tokyo, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.37,0:56:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll take all my savings.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.37,0:56:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You better pay me back, Mr. College Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.14,0:56:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.55,0:56:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Souta, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.66,0:56:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.88,0:56:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,This train is {\i1}so{\i0} fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.13,0:56:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.53,0:56:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...it's fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.72,0:56:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We will soon arrive at Atami. The doors on the...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.05,0:56:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Souta, did we just...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.23,0:56:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.16,0:57:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Did we just miss Mt. Fuji?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.68,0:57:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.93,0:57:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you say something!?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.35,0:57:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahh, right...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.50,0:57:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to see it...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.37,0:57:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.08,0:57:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll soon be arriving at Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.50,0:57:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Tokyo. This is the final stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.93,0:57:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That way, Suzume.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.76,0:57:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.32,0:57:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.04,0:57:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Left.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.01,0:57:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Go up.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.25,0:57:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Train on the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.37,0:57:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.85,0:57:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off, next stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.60,0:57:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What!?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.57,0:57:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do I feel like your horse?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.43,0:57:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Before Daijin, there's a place I want to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.72,0:57:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you make a call?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.90,0:57:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.42,0:57:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, my name is Iwato.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.57,0:58:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I just phoned...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.96,0:58:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.41,0:58:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Souta's relative.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.23,0:58:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.23,0:58:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the key to his room.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.82,0:58:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Room 301.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.14,0:58:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Take your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.91,0:58:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, aren't you popular, Souta?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.57,0:58:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.44,0:58:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,When is he coming back from his trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.17,0:58:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a bit lonely without him.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.15,0:58:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He's so sweet and cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.98,0:58:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And gorgeous.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.03,0:58:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't take them seriously...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.61,0:58:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Really...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.28,0:58:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.95,0:58:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Scuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.56,0:58:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to look something up.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.43,0:58:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,See the cardboard box on top of the shelf?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.20,0:58:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Grab it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.20,0:58:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.23,0:58:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oof...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.60,0:59:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Souta, can I step on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.41,0:59:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Ask that {\i1}before{\i0} you do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.49,0:59:17.32,Signs,,0,0,0,,SECRET ARTS OF CLOSERS VOL.1
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.18,0:59:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.65,0:59:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,the worm?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.83,0:59:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.17,0:59:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And this is the Keystone.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.35,0:59:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The Western Pillar.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.84,0:59:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And the Eastern Pillar.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.06,0:59:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Then does that mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.62,0:59:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,...there are two Keystones.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.98,0:59:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Disasters that couldn't be contained by closing the Gate
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.00,0:59:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,were sealed away using the Keystones.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.85,0:59:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.52,0:59:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The locations change era to era.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.27,0:59:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The Keystone from Kyushu is now running around as Daijin.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.18,0:59:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.90,0:59:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The other Keystone is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.03,0:59:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,In Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.41,0:59:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Keeping the worm's head at bay.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.16,1:00:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What I want to know is exactly where...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.15,1:00:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Where in Tokyo it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.87,1:00:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently, there's a huge Gate there too.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.95,1:00:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It opened 100 years ago and decimated the Kanto region.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.21,1:00:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And was shut by the Closers of that time.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.80,1:00:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Tokyo's Gate.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.30,1:00:17.05,Signs,,0,0,0,,CLOSER'S JOURNAL
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.16,1:00:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps Daijin is trying to open that door once more.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.85,1:00:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.19,1:00:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The information has been blotted out.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.41,1:00:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.32,1:00:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the location a secret?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.93,1:00:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I've gotta ask Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.67,1:00:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.07,1:00:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,He pretty much raised me.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.77,1:00:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He's in a hospital nearby.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.01,1:00:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't want to disappoint him...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.31,1:00:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,looking like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.73,1:00:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Souta, you in there?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.60,1:00:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.08,1:00:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The window's open.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.66,1:00:51.82,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,It's Serizawa.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.82,1:00:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Of all the times...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.23,1:00:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-Who?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.42,1:00:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.26,1:00:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Just make him go away.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.66,1:00:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Souta! I'm opening the door, dude.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.57,1:00:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming in.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.09,1:01:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I warned ya.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.09,1:01:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a good guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.10,1:01:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.65,1:01:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, and you are?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.67,1:01:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,His younger sister.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.24,1:01:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got a sister?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.67,1:01:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Well... A cousin who's {\i1}like{\i0} a younger sister, really.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.32,1:01:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.02,1:01:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Umm...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.90,1:01:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You're Serizawa, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.36,1:01:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Teacher employment exam?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.99,1:01:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.56,1:01:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yesterday was the second one, but he didn't show up.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.34,1:01:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,He had a test yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.90,1:01:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What an idiot...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.63,1:01:33.13,Signs,,0,0,0,,TEACHER EMPLOYMENT EXAM PREP
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.85,1:01:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Four years right down the drain.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.53,1:01:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It bothered me so much, I couldn't focus on my test.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.48,1:01:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, you...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.53,1:01:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume, was it?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.04,1:01:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,When you get a hold of Souta,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.70,1:01:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,tell him that I'm pissed, and that he's dead to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.76,1:01:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.13,1:01:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,He owes me 20,000 yen.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.67,1:01:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I want that first.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.48,1:01:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard his family business was in trouble and all...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.23,1:01:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But, he doesn't take care of himself enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.69,1:01:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ticks me off.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.60,1:01:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,See ya.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.91,1:02:04.16,Signs,,0,0,0,,EARTHQUAKE WARNING
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.16,1:02:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there gonna be a quake?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.91,1:02:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you—
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.00,1:02:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It stopped...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.62,1:02:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.68,1:02:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's close.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.04,1:02:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that's a lot of birds.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.27,1:02:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.68,1:02:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.48,1:02:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.92,1:02:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I had no idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.52,1:02:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,About your test!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.26,1:02:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.01,1:02:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not your fault!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.24,1:02:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's all because I freed the Keystone!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.37,1:02:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We put an end to it today.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.83,1:02:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We return the cat to the Keystone, and I become human again.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.71,1:02:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.62,1:02:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So many birds!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.20,1:02:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of the earthquake?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.04,1:02:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, where's the Gate!?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.76,1:02:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.73,1:02:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like it's downriver.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.91,1:03:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.43,1:03:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,A cat?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.90,1:03:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.36,1:03:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's play.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.21,1:03:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Daijin!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.98,1:03:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.98,1:03:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.05,1:03:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,A chair!?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.72,1:03:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see that?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.48,1:03:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What was it?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.32,1:03:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.50,1:03:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Daijin!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.83,1:03:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Return to the Keystone!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.60,1:03:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,One is not enough!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.44,1:03:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.13,1:03:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Why!?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.36,1:03:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You still don't get it?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.62,1:03:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd you go!?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.84,1:03:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Souta?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.32,1:03:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Tokyo's Gate is...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.44,1:03:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,down there?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.06,1:03:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,How do we even get there!?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.44,1:04:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It stopped?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.80,1:04:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.10,1:04:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.31,1:04:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.16,1:04:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Earthquake warning.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.82,1:04:47.53,Signs,,0,0,0,,EARTHQUAKE WARNING
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.33,1:04:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The warning stopped.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.42,1:04:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.92,1:04:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The second Keystone...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.16,1:04:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha—
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.98,1:04:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It couldn't hold it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.09,1:05:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole body is coming out!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.05,1:05:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Daijin!?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.62,1:05:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We {\i1}will{\i0} prevent a major earthquake.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.81,1:05:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.00,1:05:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.85,1:05:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't be serious!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.10,1:05:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Souta!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.02,1:05:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, is that...?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.79,1:05:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.53,1:05:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.60,1:05:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume!?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.77,1:05:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.29,1:05:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.92,1:05:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's weird...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.04,1:05:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy!?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.02,1:05:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.21,1:05:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume!!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.73,1:05:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.47,1:06:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Souta?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.36,1:06:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The surface is unstable.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.58,1:06:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let go.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.30,1:06:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.13,1:06:30.88,Signs,,0,0,0,,EARTHQUAKE EPICENTER THE 23 DISTRICTS
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.58,1:07:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The worm...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.25,1:07:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,is covering the city.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.30,1:07:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Souta!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.43,1:07:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.32,1:07:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to pierce it with the Keystone...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.48,1:07:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,with Daijin.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.12,1:07:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.35,1:07:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,When the worm falls...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.39,1:07:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,the earth will break.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.10,1:07:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Daijin!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.38,1:07:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Souta?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.68,1:07:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.03,1:07:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,A lot of people...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.04,1:07:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,are about to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.10,1:07:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you let that happen!?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.20,1:07:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Become the Keystone again!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.28,1:07:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.15,1:07:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm no longer the Keystone.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.03,1:07:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You are the Keystone.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.78,1:07:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.44,1:07:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do, Souta?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.55,1:07:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Souta?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.78,1:08:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume... I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.73,1:08:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.38,1:08:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't realize...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.37,1:08:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,or maybe didn't want to.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.23,1:08:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Souta?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.52,1:08:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Your body...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.43,1:08:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Now...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.05,1:08:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's freezing!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.27,1:08:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I am...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.40,1:08:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,the Keystone.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.74,1:08:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The moment I became a chair,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.49,1:08:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,the role of a Keystone was passed on to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.84,1:08:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't be...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.59,1:08:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.13,1:08:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This is where I end?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.83,1:08:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Souta?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.99,1:08:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But, I was able to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.34,1:08:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Souta? Souta!?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.26,1:08:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Souta!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.94,1:08:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Souta!?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.62,1:08:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not Souta anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.59,1:08:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Daijin...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.82,1:08:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.60,1:08:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you going to stick that into the worm?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.66,1:08:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I!?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.61,1:08:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The worm's gonna fall.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.34,1:08:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The earth will break.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.56,1:09:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's falling...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.21,1:09:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Souta!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.16,1:09:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.74,1:09:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Souta!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.63,1:09:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not Souta anymore!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.73,1:09:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Souta, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.88,1:09:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.01,1:09:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Souta!?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.15,1:09:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,SOUTA!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.57,1:09:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Lots'a people are gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.15,1:09:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,History will repeat...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.85,1:09:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.82,1:09:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I never wanted this...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.78,1:09:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,How can this...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.70,1:10:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look at that!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.68,1:10:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.90,1:10:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Aurora?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.40,1:10:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Rainbow at night?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.69,1:10:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Beautiful...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.46,1:11:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.32,1:11:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it ready yet?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.29,1:11:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even close.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.22,1:11:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Now?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.38,1:11:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.66,1:11:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Now?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.65,1:11:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, almost?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.43,1:11:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Nooow?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.10,1:11:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.98,1:11:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.73,1:11:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday, Suzume.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.95,1:11:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoooa.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.80,1:11:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, is its face here?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.55,1:11:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.28,1:11:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a chair.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.35,1:11:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Just for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.90,1:11:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,How's that?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.33,1:11:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,A chair for me!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.39,1:11:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.98,1:12:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna keep it
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.49,1:12:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,forever and ever!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.89,1:12:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Forever?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.60,1:12:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, thank goodness I built it for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.51,1:12:12.26,Signs,,0,0,0,,MAY 24: TODAY MY MOM BUILT ME A CHAIR...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.75,1:12:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,How long...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.14,1:12:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,did I actually care for it?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.03,1:12:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Where...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.03,1:12:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,...am I?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.11,1:12:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Souta?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.08,1:12:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this...?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.24,1:12:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Tokyo's Gate!?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.71,1:13:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Souta!?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.72,1:13:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't get in.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.85,1:13:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,He's in the Ever-After.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.71,1:13:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Souta.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.13,1:13:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Souta?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.22,1:13:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Souta!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.74,1:13:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Souta!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.20,1:13:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.20,1:13:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, just the two of us!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.70,1:13:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all your fault!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.96,1:13:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me Souta back!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.28,1:13:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.00,1:13:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.99,1:13:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not human anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.31,1:13:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Then make him human!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.15,1:13:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume, that hurts.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.74,1:13:53.75,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,Bring him back now!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.75,1:13:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I said that hurts!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.60,1:13:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You—!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.57,1:14:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't love me?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.00,1:14:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.63,1:14:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I!?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.35,1:14:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You love me, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.50,1:14:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate—!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.74,1:14:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Go away.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.24,1:14:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't ever talk to me again.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.12,1:14:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume doesn't love me...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.96,1:14:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise, I'll come save you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.29,1:14:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I return to you...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.17,1:15:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.18,1:15:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look at that girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.04,1:15:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not wearing any shoes.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.54,1:15:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right. Ew.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.44,1:15:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at her clothes.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.05,1:15:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That girl over there.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.44,1:15:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Is she barefoot?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.26,1:15:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,For real?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.53,1:15:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Munakata's condition has stabilized.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.68,1:15:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it was pretty bad yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.81,1:15:49.57,Signs,,0,0,0,,HITSUJIRO MUNAKATA
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.70,1:15:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Souta's...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.75,1:16:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Souta failed, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.90,1:16:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry for barging in...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.35,1:16:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard from Souta that you were in the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.44,1:16:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he drag you into this?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.07,1:16:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What is the fate of my grandson?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.43,1:16:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He became a Keystone and went to the Ever-After...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.58,1:16:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.04,1:16:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw the worm from my window yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.45,1:16:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted nothing more than to go myself...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.30,1:16:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,but this old body of mine wouldn't listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.56,1:16:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I want to know how to enter the Ever-After.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.06,1:16:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.38,1:16:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Because... we have to save Souta!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.66,1:16:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That isn't necessary.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.63,1:16:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.68,1:16:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Souta will spend decades now
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.19,1:17:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,as a Keystone housing the gods.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.85,1:17:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He is no longer of our realm.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.39,1:17:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,How could...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.89,1:17:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But there must be a way to—
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.22,1:17:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to waste my grandson's sacrifice?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.43,1:17:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.15,1:17:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is the one who pierced the worm?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.27,1:17:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you, with Souta?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.52,1:17:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But that was...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.41,1:17:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.66,1:17:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It was me!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.00,1:17:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.42,1:17:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That's fine!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.13,1:17:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If you didn't, millions would have died!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.56,1:17:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Take pride in your deed, keep your mouth shut,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.71,1:17:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,and return to whence you came!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.90,1:17:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,This world is not for the ordinary.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.41,1:17:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget everything that happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.12,1:17:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I forget?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.16,1:17:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll open the underground Gate again.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.05,1:17:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What!? What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.39,1:17:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to get in!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.04,1:17:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.98,1:17:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You cannot enter it there!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.77,1:18:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You mustn't open the Gate!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.98,1:18:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.21,1:18:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ever-After is a beautiful place.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.82,1:18:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But it is the domain of the departed.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.09,1:18:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that not scare you?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.38,1:18:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.97,1:18:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Whether one lives or dies is a matter of luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.97,1:18:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I've always felt that way.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.11,1:18:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.61,1:18:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid of a world without Souta.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.71,1:18:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,There is but one Gate through which\Npeople may traverse in their lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.25,1:18:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been to the Ever-After before, no?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.40,1:18:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you see there?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.33,1:18:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That was...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.96,1:18:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,A young version of myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.24,1:19:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And, my mom...who passed away.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.76,1:19:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I suspect you got lost in \Nthe Ever-After when you were young.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.15,1:19:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You must find {\i1}that{\i0} Gate. From back then.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.01,1:19:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It has been far too long.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.02,1:19:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I see you are finally unbound.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.63,1:19:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you wish to follow that girl?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.16,1:19:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I entrust everything to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.97,1:20:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm borrowing your shoes, Souta.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.40,1:20:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.45,1:20:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.67,1:20:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.32,1:20:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Serizawa?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.22,1:20:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.80,1:20:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,To find Souta?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.14,1:20:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,To find a door.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.58,1:20:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.49,1:20:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'm in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.92,1:20:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I looked everywhere for you!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.16,1:20:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What are—
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.60,1:20:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The cousin thing's a lie, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.12,1:21:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does it matter?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.36,1:21:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Get in.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.86,1:21:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.63,1:21:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going after Souta, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.99,1:21:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, I'll take you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.29,1:21:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you—
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.48,1:21:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm worried about my friend, okay!?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.88,1:21:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.53,1:21:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,A fight?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.41,1:21:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.19,1:21:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume!!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.43,1:21:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,W-What? Tamaki?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.56,1:21:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have {\i1}any{\i0} idea how worried I've been!?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.69,1:21:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And you! You stay away from her.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.19,1:21:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Or I'll call the police.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.39,1:21:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Who're you?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.19,1:21:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this the guy who came to our house?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.08,1:21:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever he told you is a lie.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.19,1:21:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.60,1:21:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I can't yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.22,1:21:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.82,1:21:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Serizawa, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.30,1:21:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.85,1:21:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.48,1:21:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.37,1:21:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck is wrong with you!?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.96,1:21:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let you go alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.64,1:21:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Tamaki, get out.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.73,1:21:42.96,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,Come here, Suzume.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.96,1:21:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This car has doors, you know!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.82,1:21:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he two-timing?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.20,1:21:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Men are such pigs.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.47,1:21:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's all calm dow—
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.70,1:21:49.83,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and you ignored them!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.83,1:21:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you guys...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.69,1:21:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,done yet?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.53,1:21:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Daijin?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.22,1:21:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,A cat spoke!?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.69,1:21:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Of course not...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.79,1:22:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.65,1:22:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, cats don't talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.24,1:22:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,More importantly...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.31,1:22:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Destination confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.72,1:22:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Serizawa, can you take us here?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.63,1:22:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Whaaat!? This is far!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.24,1:22:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume, isn't this...?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.14,1:22:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You said you would take me, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.17,1:22:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, I have to go there.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.43,1:22:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.83,1:22:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess we're not comin' back tonight...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.80,1:22:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you trying to pull?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.77,1:22:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ In order to see his mom...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.91,1:22:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ I boarded the train all on my own!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.28,1:23:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ ...the twilit cityscape and cars passing by
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.14,1:23:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ I watched out the corner of my eye.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.08,1:23:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you mind?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.66,1:23:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What? This is the perfect road trip song.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.55,1:23:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And we have a cat...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.55,1:23:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume's not listening.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.55,1:23:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,She's asleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.06,1:23:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, is that cat hers?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.31,1:23:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have any cats.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.85,1:23:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Serizawa...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.31,1:23:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a teacher in training?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.32,1:23:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, yeah...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.32,1:23:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna become one.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.37,1:23:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this car okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.91,1:23:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's used. I got it super cheap.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.47,1:23:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Cool, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.83,1:23:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you want to do this?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.18,1:23:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's more than seven hours one way.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.92,1:23:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Your daughter's not the only one looking for Souta.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.77,1:23:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not my daughter...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.87,1:23:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,She's my niece.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.45,1:23:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,My older sister passed away, so I took her in.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.84,1:23:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,She was a single mom.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.10,1:23:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.22,1:24:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Back then, Suzume was only four.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.48,1:24:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,She couldn't process her mother disappearing so suddenly...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.72,1:24:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,and got lost trying to search for her.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.66,1:24:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.86,1:24:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.35,1:24:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume!!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.72,1:24:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Auntie?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.31,1:24:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything's all right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.07,1:24:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry it took me so long to find you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.68,1:24:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Starting today, you're my daughter, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.33,1:24:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been 12 years since that day.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.50,1:24:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I took her with me to Kyushu,\Nand we've lived together ever since.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.94,1:24:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, do you mind the smoke?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.79,1:24:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your car.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.20,1:24:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So, we're headed for Suzume's hometown then?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.26,1:24:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Souta really gonna be there?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.22,1:24:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.26,1:24:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's nothing left there.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.52,1:24:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, why don't we head back to Tokyo?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.57,1:24:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll make her give up.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.73,1:25:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Souta owes me money, and I need it back.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.41,1:25:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're a loan shark now?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.19,1:25:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ And she'll be so mad at you, my darling!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.18,1:25:18.09,Signs,,0,0,0,,CONTAMINATED SOIL
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.26,1:25:20.92,Signs,,0,0,0,,EVACUATION ZONE AHEAD
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.15,1:25:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ I guess it's the pain that brings back those memories
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.15,1:25:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ All of the ones that I Thought were all dead and gone
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.24,1:25:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you just feel something shake?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.31,1:25:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Look who decided to join us.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.44,1:25:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Now your aunt's asleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.20,1:25:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Does your family not know how to sleep?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.99,1:25:48.96,Signs,,0,0,0,,EARTHQUAKE WARNING INTENSITY 3.0
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.28,1:25:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right. I didn't realize it.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.19,1:25:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.51,1:25:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wa—!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.68,1:25:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.56,1:26:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not appearing.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.63,1:26:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Souta must be containing it.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.95,1:26:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Daijin...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.39,1:26:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you trying to do?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.30,1:26:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Why won't you say anything?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.67,1:26:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, can anyone...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.18,1:26:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,become a Keystone?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.32,1:26:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Not just Closers?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.20,1:26:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Heeey!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.09,1:26:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.90,1:26:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up with you?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.70,1:26:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.12,1:26:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta hurry.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.18,1:26:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We're about halfway now.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.45,1:27:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know this area was so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.88,1:27:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is...beautiful?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.29,1:27:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, we need to get going.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.46,1:27:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.26,1:27:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.26,1:27:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Cat!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.09,1:27:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.70,1:27:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Man...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.95,1:27:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Your family's got some serious issues...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.97,1:27:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ What is it you're looking for?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.14,1:27:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Something hard to find?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.26,1:27:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ In your bag, through your desk
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.43,1:28:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ you looked but can't find it.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.50,1:28:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Do you want to keep searching?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.42,1:28:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Why not dance with me instead?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.84,1:28:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Into our dreams, on into our dreams.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.26,1:28:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Wouldn't you rather roam a bit?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.33,1:28:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Rain?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.38,1:28:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.10,1:28:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's not good...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.00,1:28:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Why? You have a roof, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.99,1:28:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Just close it.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.28,1:28:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's give it a go.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.06,1:28:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.51,1:28:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, still broken.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.08,1:28:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Haha.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.02,1:28:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't "Haha" me!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.40,1:28:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,How're you gonna fix this!?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.56,1:28:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,No worries.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.59,1:28:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We're almost to the next rest stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.81,1:28:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Approximately 40km to your destination. ETA 35 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.24,1:28:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost, my foot!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.56,1:29:03.57,Signs,,0,0,0,,OYA KAIGAN - REST STOP
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.35,1:29:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The time is 3:30PM.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.61,1:29:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the grub!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.57,1:29:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.07,1:29:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're with some shady playboy?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.20,1:29:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, more like a discount hustler,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.32,1:29:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,but I don't think he's up to anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.17,1:29:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That's super dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.45,1:29:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just you two girls.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.41,1:29:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,A closed car's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.78,1:29:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's a convertible.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.88,1:29:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That's even worse!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.93,1:29:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Tamaki, where in Miyagi are you now?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.99,1:29:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Yes, got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.60,1:29:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Wait one sec.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.69,1:29:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Tamaki again?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.76,1:29:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Minoru doesn't give up, does he?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.05,1:29:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a bus at that rest stop headed for Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.33,1:29:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And there are open seats.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.16,1:29:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I can book 'em right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.53,1:29:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Just hold up, Minoru.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.65,1:29:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,We've come quite a ways...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.63,1:29:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think that...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.33,1:29:54.57,Signs,,0,0,0,,EARTHQUAKE WARNING INTENSITY 3.0
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.78,1:30:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Souta.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.11,1:30:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Souta...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.93,1:30:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume, it just shook again, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.53,1:30:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,There are so many earthquakes lately.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.48,1:30:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you sure you don't want anything to eat?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.64,1:30:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.71,1:30:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.16,1:30:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you tell me?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.20,1:30:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.73,1:30:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you so hell-bent on returning home?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.15,1:30:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,A door...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.12,1:30:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, it's hard to explain.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.48,1:30:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.89,1:30:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,After all the trouble you've caused!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.09,1:30:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Trouble?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.72,1:30:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't understand anyway, Tamaki.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.19,1:30:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it. We're taking that bus home.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.28,1:30:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't tell me anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.82,1:30:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You look depressed.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.94,1:30:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't eat.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.38,1:30:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.91,1:30:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.76,1:30:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You go home, Tamaki!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.75,1:30:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I never asked you to come after me!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.84,1:30:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea!?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.55,1:31:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I was worried sick!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.39,1:31:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That's exactly why I'm suffocating!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.31,1:31:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't...take this anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.35,1:31:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I had to take you in.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.05,1:31:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I devoted the last 10 years to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.91,1:31:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm such an idiot...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.01,1:31:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Every day I walk on eggshells.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.81,1:31:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,A child who lost her mother?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.23,1:31:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I could never have anyone over because of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.31,1:31:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And who would marry someone who's basically got a kid?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.39,1:31:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Even with my sister's money, there's no balancing that scale.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.13,1:31:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that...?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.16,1:31:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's not like I...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.44,1:31:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sorry it took me so long...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.38,1:31:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,had a choice, either.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.57,1:31:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're my daughter...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.95,1:31:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who said, "You're my daughter"!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.95,1:31:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't remember that.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.19,1:32:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of my house.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.71,1:32:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me back my life!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.14,1:32:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Who... are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.53,1:32:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sadaijin.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.04,1:32:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Sadaijin?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.70,1:32:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hey, Tamaki?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.67,1:32:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened!?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.46,1:32:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.05,1:32:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What did I...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.46,1:32:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I have to—
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.54,1:32:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Serizawa.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.97,1:32:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.44,1:33:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'm losing it...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.66,1:33:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would I say something like that?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.45,1:33:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.89,1:33:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.71,1:33:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.02,1:33:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup... Seriously big issues.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.12,1:33:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ I took the button on my uniform...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.65,1:33:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ A Valentine's day kiss!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.39,1:33:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.31,1:33:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Not this.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.33,1:33:26.96,Signs,,0,0,0,,STOP FIGHTING
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.96,1:33:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,There ya go.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.96,1:33:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ Please stop the fighting, both of you...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.16,1:33:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ I don't want you two... to fight over me
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.29,1:33:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This car's pretty great when it's sunny, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.21,1:33:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Umm... Do you mind?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.72,1:33:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.72,1:33:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm choosing the songs that suit my audience.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.51,1:33:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You appreciate the oldies, right, Suzume?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.26,1:33:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess the rain ain't done yet...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.92,1:33:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, newcomer?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.60,1:34:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,How did we pick up another stray?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.14,1:34:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And a huge one, at that.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:03.38,1:34:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, a rainbow.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.74,1:34:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Now there's a good sign.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.44,1:34:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Man.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.47,1:34:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Tough crowd.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.43,1:34:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume, cats don't follow people without a reason.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.64,1:34:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Unlike dogs.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.08,1:34:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Those black and white cats...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.81,1:34:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,must really want something from you.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.91,1:34:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Precisely.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:28.23,1:34:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha—
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.33,1:34:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Return everything as it was, with human hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.77,1:34:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It spoke!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.35,1:34:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah...hey, hey, he—
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.26,1:34:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding me...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.00,1:34:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's fixed.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.84,1:35:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.72,1:35:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That could've ended much worse.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.92,1:35:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind that. Did those cats just talk?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.19,1:35:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,T-They totally did, didn't they?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.56,1:35:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck was that?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.69,1:35:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Supernatural stuff?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.55,1:35:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, that can't be possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.31,1:35:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.51,1:35:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They won't stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.20,1:35:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Serizawa!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.40,1:35:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We're about 10km out, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.59,1:35:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Approximately 20km to your destination.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.52,1:35:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,More like 20.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.19,1:35:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's still quite a ways away.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.49,1:35:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Return to the designated route.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.62,1:35:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.58,1:35:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna run the rest.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.88,1:35:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much, Serizawa!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.08,1:35:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You too, Tamaki!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.55,1:35:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going too.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.83,1:35:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for getting us this far.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.10,1:35:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you might actually make a great teacher...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.27,1:36:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hey, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.04,1:36:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck was that all about?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.69,1:36:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, I envy you, Souta.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.00,1:36:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Tamaki?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.07,1:36:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I give up.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.96,1:36:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,This is about you chasing someone you love, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.38,1:36:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-This isn't a love thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.88,1:36:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Suzume...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.95,1:36:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are these guys?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.78,1:36:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,They're supposed to be gods?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.49,1:36:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Gods!?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.55,1:36:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What I said, in the parking lot...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.05,1:37:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, I've felt that way at times...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.34,1:37:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's not the only thing I've felt.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.04,1:37:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.24,1:37:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You understand it's not the only thing...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:08.48,1:37:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.69,1:37:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Tamaki.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.10,1:37:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Your first time home in 12 years.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.06,1:37:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm home, Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.43,1:37:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm home, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.42,1:37:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at how much she's grown, Sis.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.51,1:37:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea what she's about to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:56.02,1:37:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Found it.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.77,1:38:08.03,Signs,,0,0,0,,SUZUME'S IMPORTANT STUFF
Dialogue: 0,1:38:09.22,1:38:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,A diary?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.49,1:38:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:12.16,1:38:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't remember exactly what happened back then.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.85,1:38:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But I do remember wandering through a door...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.79,1:38:31.29,Signs,,0,0,0,,MARCH 11
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.48,1:38:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Tsunami warning.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.52,1:38:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Those near the ocean,\Nplease evacuate to high ground immediately.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.51,1:38:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Have you seen my mommy?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.43,1:38:47.22,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Are you alone?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.08,1:38:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}She was working at the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.97,1:38:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you seen my mommy?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:48.88,1:38:51.22,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,They haven't found Tsubame?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:50.31,1:38:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That girl's still looking today.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.48,1:38:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know where my mommy is?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.98,1:38:55.80,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,She's only four...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.95,1:38:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Her mother's probably—
Dialogue: 0,1:38:55.93,1:38:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The poor thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.81,1:38:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you seen my mommy?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.08,1:38:59.89,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,She's all alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.09,1:39:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Suzume.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.89,1:39:01.79,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,My mommy...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:01.79,1:39:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.39,1:39:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.71,1:39:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.57,1:39:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't...a dream.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.78,1:39:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, the moon was full that night.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.48,1:39:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Right by that telephone pole.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.66,1:39:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.88,1:39:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You're looking for this door?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:22.52,1:39:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Suzume!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.19,1:39:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been 12 years! The rubble's probably long gone!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.75,1:39:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Where?!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:37.67,1:39:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.97,1:39:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Daijin?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.12,1:39:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what're...?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.86,1:40:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Daijin, have you...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.74,1:40:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you been guiding us to the open doors all this time?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.44,1:40:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This whole time...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.24,1:40:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:18.52,1:40:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much, Daijin!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.93,1:40:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Suzume!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.20,1:40:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.00,1:40:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Tamaki.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.02,1:40:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.50,1:40:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Going where?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:32.01,1:40:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,To see the person I love!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.02,1:40:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:54.35,1:40:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The ground is on fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.28,1:41:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:00.77,1:41:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The worm!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:06.79,1:41:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's going for the Gate!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.72,1:41:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Sadaijin?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:37.02,1:41:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:38.65,1:41:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Souta!?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.97,1:42:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Daijin, you...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:02.43,1:42:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:07.14,1:42:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.52,1:42:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Ever-After?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:12.86,1:42:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Souta!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:02.23,1:43:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Souta!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:03.38,1:43:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Souta!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.38,1:43:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:13.59,1:43:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,If you take the Keystone,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.95,1:43:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,the worm will escape.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.84,1:43:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll become the Keystone!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:20.02,1:43:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So please...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.43,1:43:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, Souta!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:28.77,1:43:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:42.49,1:43:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Souta!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:43.84,1:43:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I've come this far!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:47.35,1:43:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, answer me!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.00,1:43:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Souta!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.43,1:43:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me hear your voice.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:53.26,1:43:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Souta!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.00,1:43:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Souta!!!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:02.82,1:44:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:06.72,1:44:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know of any ruins in this area?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.36,1:44:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ruins?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.90,1:44:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you not afraid to die!?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:15.73,1:44:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:16.69,1:44:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We make a great team!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:18.54,1:44:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'm doing something pretty important!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:20.65,1:44:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Join us.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:22.03,1:44:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, aren't you popular, Souta?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:24.70,1:44:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:26.39,1:44:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:27.58,1:44:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.58,1:44:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:29.84,1:44:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.60,1:44:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This is where I end?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:33.46,1:44:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Souta's memories?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:36.73,1:44:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But I was able to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:37.82,1:44:38.74,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,Souta?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:39.15,1:44:40.16,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,Souta!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:40.16,1:44:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Souta!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:42.24,1:44:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally met you!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:43.72,1:44:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Souta!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:44.76,1:44:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to disappear.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:46.26,1:44:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to live!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:47.55,1:44:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to keep living!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:48.80,1:44:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid to die!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:50.81,1:44:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to live.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:51.81,1:44:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,To live...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:52.93,1:44:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,To live.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:54.06,1:44:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,More!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.50,1:44:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So do I!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.95,1:45:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to live more...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.34,1:45:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to hear your voice.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:03.83,1:45:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to be alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:05.35,1:45:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:07.43,1:45:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Souta...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:46.49,1:45:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Souta?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:49.67,1:45:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:53.50,1:45:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What was I...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:57.60,1:45:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Daijin?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:59.83,1:46:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:01.50,1:46:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:05.00,1:46:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,1:46:06.85,1:46:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,couldn't become your cat, Suzume.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:11.00,1:46:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Return me...
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.51,1:46:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,...with your hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:20.15,1:46:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Daijin...
Dialogue: 0,1:46:30.87,1:46:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The second Keystone!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:33.60,1:46:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The worm's going to escape from the Gate!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:59.07,1:46:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:59.92,1:47:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.60,1:47:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:02.56,1:47:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hear their voices, and they'll hear us.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:05.09,1:47:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:15.72,1:47:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,O Divine Gods who dwell beneath this land...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:19.33,1:47:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You have long protected us for generations...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:22.58,1:47:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Thy mountains and rivers that we have long called our own...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:25.96,1:47:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,We respectfully return to thee!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.30,1:47:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Morning!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:36.14,1:47:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:38.82,1:47:40.36,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Bon appetit!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:40.36,1:47:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Thanks for the food.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:43.29,1:47:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}See you soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:45.23,1:47:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Come home soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:46.23,1:47:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}See you later!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:46.82,1:47:47.57,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Come home soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:47.57,1:47:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}See you soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:48.73,1:47:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm off now.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:49.57,1:47:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Take care.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:50.74,1:47:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Come home soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:50.15,1:47:51.40,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,{\i1}See you later.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:51.40,1:47:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't be too late!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:51.99,1:47:52.99,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll see you soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:52.49,1:47:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Take care!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:52.99,1:47:54.24,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,{\i1}See you soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:54.24,1:47:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}See you later.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:57.12,1:47:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that life is fleeting.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.31,1:48:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We live side-by-side with death.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.19,1:48:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Even then...
Dialogue: 0,1:48:05.97,1:48:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,once more...
Dialogue: 0,1:48:07.42,1:48:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,even for just one moment more
Dialogue: 0,1:48:09.80,1:48:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,we wish to live!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:12.63,1:48:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Divine gods!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:14.68,1:48:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Please... Please!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:17.22,1:48:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg of you!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:25.04,1:48:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:25.98,1:48:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Entrust yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:49.27,1:48:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I return to you!!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:38.38,1:49:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume...
Dialogue: 0,1:49:57.92,1:50:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume, there's someone here...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:01.23,1:50:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,A child?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:03.11,1:50:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That girl...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:04.16,1:50:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to go!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:06.93,1:50:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:17.75,1:50:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:19.76,1:50:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:22.84,1:50:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally understand!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:33.44,1:50:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:36.10,1:50:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:42.92,1:50:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:46.42,1:50:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:49.35,1:50:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know where my mommy is?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:51.68,1:50:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I know she's looking for me, too!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:53.72,1:50:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And she must be super worried!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:55.46,1:50:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to go to where she is!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:58.01,1:50:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume, you're...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:58.96,1:51:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,My mommy works at the hospital,
Dialogue: 0,1:51:01.97,1:51:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,and she's really good at cooking and wood stuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:05.35,1:51:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,She can make anything!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:06.97,1:51:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume—
Dialogue: 0,1:51:07.54,1:51:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And my house is...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:09.16,1:51:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gone, so...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:12.23,1:51:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:14.64,1:51:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,She just doesn't know where to look for me, so...!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:18.40,1:51:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough!!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:22.08,1:51:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Deep down, I already knew...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:26.32,1:51:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:27.30,1:51:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy's still out there! She's looking for me!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:30.70,1:51:31.57,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,Suzume!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:31.58,1:51:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:36.71,1:51:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy!!!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:42.48,1:51:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:46.56,1:51:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.30,1:51:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume, look.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.56,1:52:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:02.24,1:52:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my chair.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:04.79,1:52:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:06.06,1:52:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I say this...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:09.00,1:52:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, Suzume...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:11.04,1:52:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how sad you are now,
Dialogue: 0,1:52:13.86,1:52:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,you're going to grow up.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:19.76,1:52:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,So, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:21.86,1:52:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The future's not that scary.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:24.76,1:52:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll meet a lot of people you care for...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:27.93,1:52:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And you'll meet lots of people who'll care for you, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:32.37,1:52:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The night might seem endless right now
Dialogue: 0,1:52:35.48,1:52:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,but one day, morning will come.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:37.93,1:52:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll grow up basking in that light.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:41.41,1:52:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:43.40,1:52:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's written in the stars.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:48.64,1:52:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:49.83,1:52:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,who are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:53.14,1:52:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:56.14,1:52:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,your tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:21.72,1:53:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I completely forgot.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:25.37,1:53:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd been given everything that matters a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:34.25,1:53:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm off!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:36.92,1:53:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ Meaning of love, the touch,
Dialogue: 0,1:53:42.81,1:53:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ the theory of relativity
Dialogue: 0,1:53:48.90,1:53:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ It all seems so unreal to me,
Dialogue: 0,1:53:54.95,1:53:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ like a pipe dream in my mind
Dialogue: 0,1:53:54.83,1:53:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzume!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:55.73,1:53:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:57.23,1:53:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Tamaki!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:58.52,1:53:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Serizawa?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:00.95,1:54:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ By the time I grow up,
Dialogue: 0,1:54:06.98,1:54:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ will we ever meet?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:07.52,1:54:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, did you get your money back from Souta?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:12.15,1:54:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that... was a lie.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:14.09,1:54:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I actually owe Souta.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:14.44,1:54:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ By then, will I know the meaning of
Dialogue: 0,1:54:17.62,1:54:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like he forgot, so...
Dialogue: 0,1:54:18.77,1:54:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ thousands of love songs?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:19.42,1:54:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you keep it between us?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:22.56,1:54:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You're hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:24.08,1:54:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ But love was not a revolution or frustration or catastrophe
Dialogue: 0,1:54:29.34,1:54:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you come back with us?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:31.34,1:54:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The weight of people's feelings is what quells the land.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:32.51,1:54:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ Love was you
Dialogue: 0,1:54:35.14,1:54:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,There are still places where that's disappeared,\Ncausing the Gates to open.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:39.55,1:54:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll close them as I return to Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:43.35,1:54:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ The way you laughed somehow resembled loneliness
Dialogue: 0,1:54:47.98,1:54:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Souta! Um...
Dialogue: 0,1:54:49.31,1:54:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ The way you sang reminded me of a glow in this morning's sky
Dialogue: 0,1:54:55.12,1:55:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ Rather than humans acting thousands of years from now
Dialogue: 0,1:54:55.75,1:54:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for saving me.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:58.93,1:55:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll come see you. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:01.43,1:55:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ I'd love to see you laugh with a face no one knows yet
Dialogue: 0,1:55:07.76,1:55:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ What I don't have, what I don't have is what you are made of
Dialogue: 0,1:55:13.78,1:55:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ You make me who I am
Dialogue: 0,1:55:19.39,1:55:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ You're gonna laugh when I say this, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:25.64,1:55:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ I wanna see that face even
Dialogue: 0,1:55:31.78,1:55:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ What I don't have, what I don't have is what you are made of
Dialogue: 0,1:55:37.80,1:55:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ And who the world sings praises to
Dialogue: 0,1:55:55.29,1:56:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ "If only you were here"
Dialogue: 0,1:56:01.10,1:56:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ No matter how horrendous the words that follow may be
Dialogue: 0,1:56:10.21,1:56:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ I'll embrace those words in my arms
Dialogue: 0,1:56:16.23,1:56:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ Despair I see with you will shine brighter\Nthan the hope without you
Dialogue: 0,1:56:32.63,1:56:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:34.22,1:56:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ The way you laughed somehow resembled tenderness
Dialogue: 0,1:56:40.50,1:56:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ The way you sang was like today's evening rain
Dialogue: 0,1:56:46.52,1:56:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ Rather than humans acting thousands of years from now
Dialogue: 0,1:56:52.48,1:56:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ I'd love to see you laugh with a face no one knows yet
Dialogue: 0,1:56:58.90,1:57:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ What I don't have, what I don't have is what you are made of
Dialogue: 0,1:57:04.85,1:57:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ You make me who I am
Dialogue: 0,1:57:10.89,1:57:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ If I call your name out till my voice is gone
Dialogue: 0,1:57:16.91,1:57:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ And if that's what it takes to reach you,\Nthen I will call right now
Dialogue: 0,1:58:02.25,1:58:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ Red lines, blues lines you carry inside
Dialogue: 0,1:58:08.31,1:58:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ The twain shall meet at the center of your heart
Dialogue: 0,1:58:14.57,1:58:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ In a voice that withstands the wind
Dialogue: 0,1:58:20.77,1:58:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ I'm bringing up the words to deliver
Dialogue: 0,1:58:26.53,1:58:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ Time is a sleeper, wind the soft skin,
Dialogue: 0,1:58:32.31,1:58:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ the star is a cradle, people are a mirage
Dialogue: 0,1:58:39.28,1:58:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ If this tear answers your question of why I'm crying
Dialogue: 0,1:58:45.43,1:58:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ It's not as close to the meaning of us finding each other
Dialogue: 0,1:58:51.33,1:58:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ It's the shout that this body alone will never be enough
Dialogue: 0,1:58:57.71,1:59:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ Found a heart that trembles only when I touch your hand
Dialogue: 0,1:59:03.87,1:59:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ How many meanings must we get over to be there?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:09.73,1:59:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ Could be stupidity, could be ugliness,
Dialogue: 0,1:59:16.12,1:59:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ beyond what's right, I want to hold hands with you
Dialogue: 0,1:59:34.39,1:59:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ Precious memories I can't recall
Dialogue: 0,1:59:40.43,1:59:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ These are the thoughts that can't be put into words
Dialogue: 0,1:59:46.65,1:59:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ Maybe, just maybe
Dialogue: 0,1:59:52.74,1:59:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ That's all this heart is made of
Dialogue: 0,1:59:59.00,2:00:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ Maybe, just maybe
Dialogue: 0,2:00:05.13,2:00:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ It still beats your heart
Dialogue: 0,2:00:11.34,2:00:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ Wanting you to "notice me"
Dialogue: 0,2:00:28.61,2:00:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ If this tear answers your question of why I'm crying
Dialogue: 0,2:00:34.82,2:00:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ It's not as close to the meaning of us finding each other
Dialogue: 0,2:00:40.87,2:00:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ It's the shout that this body alone will never be enough
Dialogue: 0,2:00:47.08,2:00:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ Found a heart that trembles only when I touch your hand
Dialogue: 0,2:00:53.22,2:00:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ How many meanings must we get over to be there?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:59.31,2:01:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ Could be stupidity, could be ugliness,
Dialogue: 0,2:01:05.39,2:01:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ beyond what's right, I want to live with you
